{"v":3,"catch":"在一本關於調皮小黑貓的漫畫書裡，找出躲起來的貓咪！","desc":"這隻黑貓可是偽裝高手！你找得到牠嗎？\n\n《Cats Around Us: Black Cat》是該系列的第二部作品，你需要在五頁的無對白漫畫裡，找出藏起來的毛茸茸小可愛。\n\n在超級溫馨的故事中，看看一位男子和他那隻調皮小黑貓之間的日常——這隻小貓最愛做的事，就是把自己融入陰影之中！\n\n- 200多種隱藏物件，4頁漫畫與1張拼圖\n- 拍照與塗色模式，可定格畫面，為場景上色\n- 隨時調整遊戲色彩、亮度和對比度！","publisher":"Silesia Games","release":"2026-09-10","genres":["益智","冒險","桌上遊戲","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6cdfc01afb3c77c4a44eceea42ac30cfe10c02e6e98fb23cfc1b8ff882150488.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a1991bc903d6b595fef6304c8d08f2f053012796bdefe38b41f3852d2af54571.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3dc70e960d461bb5379ce52fc2c8887c17fc7d57c31d4d73119177f194157a9e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64d6c7117274064e5bed2ef52a7472342adf452bcce4a4969e90d569200a63de.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/822e6382b8834feb259c6b39e8f8b5b8188be47a44824238ab28515efb4258cf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/add14388c9d3cd979ccb322aedebca9e0e5c3c2bc89a824fe080ba20ab3b3133.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f4c028e40000","dlc":[]}